262 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 221 0 R
/E (SA Thread & Accessories Ltd is a renowned supplier of high-quality garments accessories. We started our operation in 2003. Since then, we are supplying garments accessories to many well-known garments in Bangladesh. We specialize in sewing thread, drawstring, draw cord, elastic and twill tape. We supply our products to over 20 renowned garments factories. Our key clients are TRZ Group, Eurozone Group, Sinha Knit and Denims Ltd, M.M Knitwear, York Group, etc. All of their raw materials are imported from countries like China, India, Malaysia, Taiwan and Thailand. Our products are 100% Oeko-Tex certified. SA Thread & Accessories Ltd. is an active member of BGAPMEA \(Membership:593\). )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
